# Pinned ToolHive CLI release archives (upstream SHA-256, from the GitHub
# release assets of stacklok/toolhive v0.42.1 — the version the D6 spike
# validated). install-server.sh refuses to install a `thv` whose archive does
# not match one of these lines: the gateway runtime is the process every
# connector workload is supervised by, so an unverified download would be the
# softest link in the whole deployment.
#
# Bumping ToolHive = replace both lines AND re-run the isolation check in
# deploy/server/verify.sh (the loopback-only default is a ToolHive behavior, not
# a Homeplane guarantee).
9c8a86be78ee21c29cf12c1bcf70bce3cc7b4de2fc3ef56e58f4d51b875ed0f1  toolhive_0.42.1_linux_amd64.tar.gz
5ec06673066be9c540bcc119896314f391861c112429cdda900bb8d1cb437ef8  toolhive_0.42.1_linux_arm64.tar.gz
